         <pt>Atribuição automática de chamados por rodízio ou menor fila para o GLPI.</pt>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en>Distributes GLPI tickets assigned to technician groups using round-robin or least-loaded strategies, respecting active user validity, open ticket limits, excluded users, and recursive entity configuration.</en>
